          "path": "_m/g/c/q/d/bull-ring-birmingham-wp/bullring-edgbaston-street-birm.jpg",
          "filename": "Bullring - Edgbaston Street, Birmingham - floral displays (9432819479).jpg",
          "caption": "On Edgbaston Street in the Bullring, Birmingham.\nI was looking on Edgbaston Street for what was marked on the Birmingham City Centre Floral Trail 2013 map as \"Market Basket\".\nDidn't see it. But Birmingham Bloom did have these 5 colourful floral features down Edgbaston Street which was nice!\nPart of Birmingham City Centre Floral Trail 2013. And Entente Florale Europe 2013.\n\nOn Sunday 28th July 2013, judges from Entente Florale went around Birmingham. Birmingham was chosen to represent the UK by the Royal Horticultural Society, due to its recent gold wins at various RHS flower shows in recent years.",
          "alt": "On Edgbaston Street in the Bullring, Birmingham.\nI was looking on Edgbaston Street for what was marked on the Birmingham City Centre Floral Trail 2013 map as \"Market Basket\".\nDidn't see it. But Birmingham Bloom did have these 5 colourful floral features down Edgbaston Street which was nice!\nPart of Birmingham City Centre Floral Trail 2013. And Entente Florale Europe 2013.\n\nOn Sunday 28th July 2013, judges from Entente Florale went around Birmingham. Birmingham was chosen to represent the UK by the Royal Horticultural Society, due to its recent gold wins at various RHS flower shows in recent years.",
